  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://sun9-47.userapi.com/impg/Wpxd8NHhhANMw9F6xR2WvJPDzCvWrAdGLz9B8w/iwwvTQIlZIY.jpg?size=220x148&quality=96&sign=d5e371d70f07285cc92e5e0323002c75&type=album\" alt=\"\" width=\"220\" height=\"148\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Пока что добавлены все 3*-мечи и несколько 4*</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Их пока нельзя получить в выживании.</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Мод добавляет оружие из Genshin Impact! Он будет постоянно обновляться.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Сначала я хочу воссоздать все мечи!</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Мечи</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><strong>3*</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Предвестник Рассвета</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://sun9-21.userapi.com/impg/ywBQ_Hm5gWZe45wa8SazO0c71bo7yqtpNjzvBA/b5X2E71UE8g.jpg?size=887x454&quality=96&sign=a7c109d2fd432471fecfc308c7516c60&type=album\" alt=\"\" width=\"887\" height=\"454\"></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Холодная Сталь</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://sun9-29.userapi.com/impg/R5Ao8pjrpVxnDCh814l20NFN5ZeCZknoev_Gvg/g8uA_XKZQ5U.jpg?size=716x432&quality=96&sign=82f6eb35f8aebab803dbd6a46291f6ea&type=album\" alt=\"\" width=\"716\" height=\"432\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Удобный Меч Путника</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://sun9-5.userapi.com/impg/5jtAAzmAvWc-1lITOjkZxo0Vt23gyhwUYBxXHw/ol3Z07SLyqg.jpg?size=821x432&quality=96&sign=dcc747906cfd62e91d21e8996b171180&type=album\" alt=\"\" width=\"821\" height=\"432\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Тёмно-Железный Меч</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://sun9-15.userapi.com/impg/T8SIy1epyk2rJeN_Z8jN6JXnWx3SNPp1rGMq8Q/VALBCI1Mf-c.jpg?size=1275x434&quality=96&sign=fb7493b6d7b419cdca2efcd6fc401c37&type=album\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"383\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;Филетный Лезвие</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://sun9-79.userapi.com/impg/35w5pLh6iGJArIFr29748NtRNpW2eJ8UXkw37A/1E5F9_Pec9Y.jpg?size=1280x392&quality=96&sign=87099ce1b1bacda0d77cf5a59ad8e836&type=album\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"345\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Меч Небесного Всадника</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://sun9-50.userapi.com/impg/zATuIAzZJ9HjEWghYtb-2uKs1tjCMpp-J6_I2g/60zDt92nzjY.jpg?size=1315x392&quality=96&sign=0f09e2924ef72ae72ee5b3000852bb55&type=album\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"335\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
